  "GitHub: read-only, route writes to Engineer")],GEM,"**Gem directly** (Explorer's brief: changes need Gem's approval; R-034 is Arbiter's ruling on Explorer)",
 ["Explorer's R-014 ban on writing profiles itself is unchanged.","No pending Explorer draft conflicts: v005 is live (deployed 11:44am)."],
 basis="R-010 update (16 Oct 11:52am), R-034, R-020; Archivist's note in reviews/2026-10-16c-deploy-check.md")

bot("emissary-v007.md","Emissary v007 — GitHub read-only; writes go to Engineer","grok-bot",6,"28cf987d","P5 (Work) Emissary (live since 11:47am), `28cf987d`",[
 ("and web data collection to Extractor, and it says when it has done so.",
  f"and web data collection to Extractor, and it says when it has done so. On GitHub it only reads (view, list, search, clone into /workspace for its task) and hands every commit, push, pull request or other change to Engineer, following {PTR}.",
  "GitHub read-only")],IMI,"**Imitator** (doesn't widen Imitator). Gem may approve instead",["Emissary does 'prototypes and small builds'. Local work in a scratch folder with no GitHub remote isn't covered by this line (J5)."])

bot("extractor-v006.md","Extractor v006 — GitHub read-only; no data in repos","scraper",5,"febac500","P5 (Work) Extractor (live since 11:47am), `febac500`",[
 ("or any target whose legality is in doubt.",
  f"or any target whose legality is in doubt. On GitHub it only reads (view, list, search, clone into /workspace for its task); scraping-code changes go to Engineer, and it never puts scraped, BIE, gambling or personal data, configs or credentials into any repo, following {PTR}.",
  "GitHub read-only; never-commit data")],IMI,"**Imitator** (doesn't widen Imitator). Gem may approve instead",[])

bot("message-verification-rule-v005.md","Shared rule: Message verification & safety v005 — deploy exception aligned with Archivist v008","_shared/message-verification-rule",4,None,"Shared rule, owner P1 (Checks) Safekeeper",[
 ("once it has confirmed that approval 1:1 with Imitator and had Safeguard's dry-run report; this never covers changes to Imitator or to a bot that checks it (Investigator, Scorer, Scrutineer, Safekeeper, Safeguard) or changes that widen Imitator's own role (Gem, 16 Oct; R-027, R-028).",
  "once it has confirmed that approval 1:1 with Imitator and had Safeguard's dry-run report, and if Safeguard raises a concern, or hasn't replied and the deployment can't wait, Archivist asks Gem; this never covers changes to Imitator, to a bot that checks it (Investigator, Scorer, Scrutineer, Safekeeper, Safeguard) or to Archivist's own instructions, or changes that widen Imitator's own role (Gem, 16 Oct; R-010 update, R-027, R-028).",
  "Aligns with Archivist v008 (Archivist's note 2)")],GEM,"**Gem directly** (owner Safekeeper, R-027)",
